## Pre-integration questions

### [CXC-R503-PRE-WAKEUP-USE] Is WAKEUP used at all

- question-state: OPEN
- question: does this build use the touch-detect pin, and if so through what conditioning? If the build polls rather than sleeps, WAKEUP is left unconnected and the whole overdrive hazard disappears at the cost of the standby mode.
- answer: EMPTY
- status: draft
- part-of: [SPEC:CXC-R503]

### [CXC-R503-PRE-LATCH-INVENTORY] What latches will a match actuate

- question-state: OPEN
- question: which physical latches, hatches or boxes will a match actuate, what is each one's enclosed volume, and can anything living be inside one when it latches? This is a physical-safety question; each integrating device's per-latch safe-state declaration cannot be written without it.
- answer: EMPTY
- status: draft
- part-of: [SPEC:CXC-R503]

### [CXC-R503-PRE-DRIVER-BASELINE] Which driver source is the baseline

- question-state: OPEN
- question: which surveyed driver is the structural baseline, and are the three touched licences (FPM, esphome, R503Lib) confirmed compatible with an open-source platform?
- answer: EMPTY
- status: draft
- part-of: [SPEC:CXC-R503]

